<title>UK: NATWEST SETS 300 MLN STG 18-YEAR BOND, +82 BP.</title>
<headline>NATWEST SETS 300 MLN STG 18-YEAR BOND, +82 BP.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager NatWest Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NATIONAL WESTMINSTER BANK PLC</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN STG   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    09.SEP.15</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    09.SEP.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+82 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  BRITAIN   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.875     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.00 PCT GILT DUE 2015</p>
<p> NOTES	SUBORDINATED ISSUE.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
